    "Please note that these warnings are just used to help the Homebrew maintainers with debugging if you file an issue. If everything you use Homebrew for is working fine: please don't worry or file an issue; just ignore this. Thanks!": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "comment": "Known Homebrew diagnostic prose; commands, paths and raw output remain verbatim.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些警告用于帮助 Homebrew 维护者排查你提交的问题。如果你使用 Homebrew 时一切正常，可以忽略这些提示，无需担心或提交问题。谢谢！"
          }
        }
      },
      "generatesSymbol": false
    },
